      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "Amane Kanata (1st costume)",
      "excerpt": "The default costume of [[hololive]]'s [[Amane Kanata]].\r\n\r\nIt consists of a [[grey jacket|grey]] [[cropped jacket]] with [[long sleeves|long]], [[wide sleeves]] going with [[sleeve cuffs]] [[sleeves past wrists|past her wrists]] with [[aiguillette]]s and a [[white sailor collar]], worn over a [[white shirt]] and a black turtleneck dress (although it's often depicted as just a separate [[turtleneck]] shirt and [[black skirt|black]] [[frilled skirt|frilled]] [[miniskirt]]), a [[blue bowtie]], a yellow [[armband]], [[blue socks|blue]] [[gingham socks|gingham]] [[kneehighs]] held up with [[legwear garter]]s and [[black boots]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #3931917: Profile\r\n* !post #4428227: Reference sheet\r\n* !post #8203052: Merchandise",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    },
